          <article class="slide"><div class="slide__grid">
            <div class="slide__media"><img src="https://www.sambodhiretreat.org/images/rooms-col1/sambodhi-retreat-bodhgaya-pyramid-cottages-1.jpg" alt="Pyramid Cottage" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="slide__sub">cottage</p>
              <h3 class="slide__name">Pyramid Cottage</h3>
              <p class="slide__text lede">A pyramid-shaped cluster of rooms panelled in pine milled from waste packaging wood. Brick corbelled walls, a slant roof and wood rendering inside make these among the most energy-efficient cottages on the property.</p>
              <ul class="slide__specs"><li><b>₹6,500</b> from / night</li><li>2–4 guests</li><li>king</li></ul>
