            <div>
              <p class="slide__sub">cottage</p>
              <h3 class="slide__name">Igloo House</h3>
              <p class="slide__text lede">An igloo-shaped cottage with a private splash pool — cold water, a cup of tea and warm snacks. The shell is built so the interior sits up to ten degrees below the outside temperature.</p>
              <ul class="slide__specs"><li><b>₹4,500</b> from / night</li><li>2 guests</li><li>king</li></ul>
