            <div>
              <p class="slide__sub">cottage</p>
              <h3 class="slide__name">Woodland Cottage</h3>
              <p class="slide__text lede">Semi-timber cottages with the look and feel of western living, overlooking a small pond with ducks on it and surrounded by palms.</p>
              <ul class="slide__specs"><li><b>₹4,000</b> from / night</li><li>2 guests</li><li>king</li></ul>
              <div class="slide__links">
