        <p style="margin-top:1.6rem;">
          <a class="tlink" href="https://www.sambodhiretreat.org/How-the-Best-Luxury-Resorts-in-Bodhgaya-Make-Wedding-Events-Special.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener">read more
